      "side": 1,
      "message": "Is there a reason not to have java_sdk_library create all of these internally? This boilerplate isn\u0027t adding any new information that the java_sdk_library doesn\u0027t already have provided to it.\n\n+paulduffin too",
      "revId": "386b5e518245c43fad38424606981fc653b089f2",
